    rdf:value """Saturday, Nov. 14, 1908
The Plymouth, Northampton.
Senda and Mr. and Mrs. McCallum met us at Springfield with a motor, and took us to the Country Club for lunch, and the motored us to Northampton, very beautiful.
Senda gave us a dinner with Professors and a large reception. I enjoyed meeting my old Professor of Chemistry, Mr. Stoddard. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 341 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1908> .

